  - npm packages. Every dependency in package.json keeps its own licence.
  - Game footage. The screenshots show the app playing film of real games.
    That footage belongs to whoever recorded it and is not licensed by this
    file.
  - Third-party photos. The repository contains none at the time of writing.
    Any added later keeps its own licence, recorded next to it.

